{"id":"614b71d8502e7bb4","group":"43","path":"43/43-cor-kt-dce-real.md","title":"每个K平凡实数都是d.c.e.实数","display":"cor-kt-dce-real — 每个K平凡实数都是d.c.e.实数","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-cor-kt-dce-real","aliases":["43-cor-kt-dce-real"],"display":"cor-kt-dce-real — 每个K平凡实数都是d.c.e.实数","depends_on":["[[43-df-ktrivial-real]]","[[43-df-dce-real]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Corollary 15.8.6; printed p.476 / PDF p.496","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-cor-kt-dce-real"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-cor-kt-dce-real</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-kt-dce-real — 每个K平凡实数都是d.c.e.实数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cea02ee793bb0f7b\" href=\"?note=cea02ee793bb0f7b\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial-real\">43-df-ktrivial-real</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2485b90ec527f97e\" href=\"?note=2485b90ec527f97e\" title=\"43-df-dce-real\">43-df-dce-real</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Corollary 15.8.6; printed p.476 / PDF p.496"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in[0,1]\">\\(\\alpha\\in[0,1]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}\">\\(\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DCEReal}\">\\(\\mathrm{DCEReal}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cea02ee793bb0f7b\" href=\"?note=cea02ee793bb0f7b\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial-real\">43-df-ktrivial-real</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2485b90ec527f97e\" href=\"?note=2485b90ec527f97e\" title=\"43-df-dce-real\">43-df-dce-real</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}(\\alpha)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{DCEReal}(\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}(\\alpha)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{DCEReal}(\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里是实数值的两个左c.e.实数之差，不能解读为数字集是两个c.e.集之差。来源用两台统一oracle机器的相对Ω之差恢复α；未声称每个d.c.e.实数都K平凡。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，Corollary 15.8.6; printed p.476 / PDF p.496。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ktrivial-real","status":"resolved","id":"cea02ee793bb0f7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ktrivial-real]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-dce-real","status":"resolved","id":"2485b90ec527f97e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-dce-real]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ktrivial-real","status":"resolved","id":"cea02ee793bb0f7b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in[0,1]$；$\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}$ 与 $\\mathrm{DCEReal}$ 见 [[43-df-ktrivial-real]]、[[43-df-dce-real]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-dce-real","status":"resolved","id":"2485b90ec527f97e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in[0,1]$；$\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}$ 与 $\\mathrm{DCEReal}$ 见 [[43-df-ktrivial-real]]、[[43-df-dce-real]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DCEReal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}(\\alpha)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{DCEReal}(\\alpha).","display":true}],"bytes":1342,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-400","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-cor-kt-dce-real]] — 每个K平凡实数都是d.c.e.实数"}],"outgoing":["cea02ee793bb0f7b","2485b90ec527f97e"]}